		(property "Description" "Sensor module interface (interface-v1): +3V3 and +5V supplies, 3.3 V logic I2C, SPI, UART on an SFP 20-pin edge connector. Signals named from the carrier side: Carrier = controller (C), module = peripheral (P); C2P = carrier to module, P2C = module to carrier. Footprint sensor_module:SFP_Plug on modules, sensor_module:SFP+ on carriers."
